  <Thumbnail>600b164f-209f-410d-ae00-f0f73812b20a</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="01-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (note FX and Flex mode charts are imcomplete and have been omitted for now as advised by manufacturer.  some function ranges are vague.  HSI modes don't appear to have saturation)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="02-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's for v1.1.0 modes." Version="10" />
  <History Date="17-10-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (firmware v1.1.6.  Flex mode is now split into 8 and 16bit.  not fully documented - assumed parameters follow corresponding modes.  FX is listed as one channel)" Version="11" />
  <History Date="19-10-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's for Flex modes." Version="12" />
  <History Date="07-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Capitalised name.  Updated in line with firmware v1.2.0 charts (adds CCT GEL modes and renumbers FX and Flex modes)" Version="13" />
  <History Date="08-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Altabase ID's for CCT GEL modes." Version="18" />
  <History Date="28-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with firmware v1.3.0 charts (revises FX mode with updated effects and parameters)" Version="19" />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
